WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:03.560
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:07.730
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:14.740
I never expected Yozora-senpai to lose.

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:20.370
Song Class is amazing too! Rola-chan even went and beat Lily-chan.

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:24.710
This isn't half bad.

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:25.920
Right?

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:34.840
It's almost my turn.

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:41.350
This is a critical performance. What should I focus on?

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:02.750
Hello?

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:04.000
Yume-chan?

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:06.710
Koharu-chan?!

00:01:13.130 --> 00:01:16.380
Koharu-chan?! Is that really you, Koharu-chan?

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:20.720
I'm sorry I've been out of contact for so long, Yume-chan.

00:01:21.890 --> 00:01:26.640
No, it's not your fault. I was just thinking about you.

00:01:29.150 --> 00:01:30.900
Koharu-chan?

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:35.950
Sorry. It's just that hearing your voice made me start to tear up.

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:43.910
I didn't want to call you until I was confident I wouldn't cry.

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:50.290
But there's something I just had to tell you now.

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:53.880
I'm glad you called. I really am, Koharu-chan.

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:59.970
I've been watching you all. Ako-chan and Mahiru-chan, Rola and Yozora-senpai and everyone else.

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:03.390
Each performance I see makes me overcome with emotion.

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:07.560
Yeah, me too.

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:11.560
You're only one step away from your dream now.

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:16.070
After admiring Hime-senpai all this time, you're finally going up against her.

00:02:16.070 --> 00:02:17.320
Yeah.

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:24.240
You're amazing, Yume-chan. You've given me the courage to chase my own dreams once more.

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:26.790
Thank you, Yume-chan.

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:31.960
Thank you for always making me smile.

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:33.920
That's what I wanted to say.

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.970
Do your best, Yume-chan!

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:41.050
She's saying thank you to me?

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:47.270
Koharu-chan and everyone else brought me here.

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:28.610
Nijino Yume, you've outdone yourself!

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:31.160
Yeah, she was blinding.

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:36.500
What'd you think, Subaru-kun?

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:39.040
It was a nice performance.

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:41.380
My little girl is all grown up.

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:43.840
That's my daughter out there!

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:45.550
Yume-chan!

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:48.050
You made me happy!

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:51.550
How did Nijino Yume do?

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:04.110
She passes Sakuraba Rola and rises to the top!

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:12.070
Everyone, thank you!

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:20.330
If you'd told me this was how Song Class's battle would've turned out a year ago, I wouldn't have believed you.

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:28.210
They've done so well surmounting the tough lessons they faced.

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:33.590
You know, I learned something from all my Aikatsu in S4.

00:07:33.590 --> 00:07:34.760
What's that?

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:45.610
You can shine far more brilliantly when you're with others than when you are alone.

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:51.360
I want to see many more idols continue to shine ever brighter.

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:55.370
To that end, I will become everyone's guiding light,

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:58.160
illuminate the path ahead,

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:02.040
and be the brightest-shining first star.{okay so there really shouldn't be a hyphen between first and star, but}{I realized my mistake last episode and fixed it}

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:12.800
The Dreaming Princess Coord. My most beloved dress.

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:17.390
She's my greatest partner, having danced upon so many stages with me.

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:18.970
Lend me your strength.

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:22.560
Shiratori Hime, ready to go!

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:26.740
I feel a pang in my chest.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:31.290
"Dreams aren't meant to be dreamed, they are to be fulfilled." {she cuts off the da yo}

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:37.000
Hime-senpai's song carried her message straight through my heart.

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:38.760
Lilienne.

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:43.260
Let's dream all sorts of new dreams, the two of us together.

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:46.760
Thank you, Yuzu.

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:50.270
I'd be disheartened if I weren't so astounded.

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:52.060
Hime-senpai.

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:57.780
I've never been so proud to share the honor of S4 with Hime.

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:02.860
Oh Tsubasa, your feelings for Hime sure run deep.

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:07.740
But I understand, since I feel the same way.

00:12:07.740 --> 00:12:13.290
Honestly, seeing Hime encourages me to work even harder.

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:17.880
It's as though she's the patron goddess of Aikatsu.

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:19.050
Yeah.

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:42.440
This concludes the Song Class performances.

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:45.200
This is the final ranking!

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:01.260
The top idol of Song Class is Shiratori Hime!

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:07.720
Congratulations, Shiratori.

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:15.140
All of my fans who have supported me,

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:19.820
the members of S4, and Four Star Academy's teachers and staff—

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:24.860
I'm grateful beyond words. Thank you very much!

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:26.700
Hime-chan!

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:28.320
Congratulations!

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:29.870
Hime-senpai!

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:34.500
Hime-senpai is still so far away.

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:40.130
This concludes the final day of the S4 Selection.

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:44.920
We will hold the S4 Crowning to officiate the results at a later date.

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:49.930
Every single idol here at Four Star Academy did a truly fabulous job!

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:54.600
Your unceasing passion lit a fire in me!

00:13:54.600 --> 00:14:00.360
That was the best S4 Selection I've 
ever seen, babies! You really got it on! {definitely didn't almost miss another baby}

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:07.150
Allow me to personally thank you all for your heartfelt support over the past four days.

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:15.120
Thank you very much!

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:18.170
Thank you very much!

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:20.170
Thank you very much!

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:23.630
Those were remarkably impressive idols.

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:25.550
Thanks, Nee-san.

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:29.680
Each flower adds to the vibrancy of the Aikatsu stage.

00:14:30.470 --> 00:14:36.560
Among them, Nijino-san and Shiratori-san blossomed into particularly large blooms.

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:42.560
Yes. Especially Nijino, whom I presented challenge after challenge this past year.

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:47.570
She never wavered and conquered them all using her own power.

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:57.700
Forgive me for causing you concern back then.

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:01.040
It's fine.

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:08.090
I don't know what happened, but if they can pull off such great performances now, that's enough for me.

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:11.760
Goodbye.

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:20.230
She has such a wonderful group of upperclassmen and friends watching over her.

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:21.020
Yeah.

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:25.940
I can hardly wait to see what lies ahead for Nijino-san.

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:30.240
How will they surpass the greatest S4 we have ever had?

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:34.870
Their next battle is already under way.{please, you're like 1/28th of the way to dimaggio already}

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:43.040
Huh, I've got the strangest craving for some sour konbu.

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:47.960
It's fine. You don't need to dance around it.

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:50.720
I-I didn't intend—

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:55.550
I feel surprisingly refreshed.

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:59.640
That was my best performance, and it went exactly as I saw it in my head.

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:06.770
Hi there. Did you forget something?

00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:07.820
Um...

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:11.780
I'm giving this to you!

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:16.660
You're holding a show?

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:21.040
I loved your singing so much that I started taking lessons!

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:23.830
I'm your fan, but now I'm your rival too!

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:26.500
Yeah.

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:35.890
How heartwarming it must be to hear that your singing inspired her to start too.

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:38.310
Looks like you've got another rival on your hands.

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:42.060
That gets me going.

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:49.110
I'll take a super spicy Hime Curry. {qc pass this was 'curry'}

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:51.360
Are you sure? It's <i>really</i> spicy.

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:52.570
I know.

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:57.570
I'm starving after all that singing.

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:05.830
Let's dig in!

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:14.090
This is good.

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:17.590
It's all over.

00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:20.010
I had so much fun up there.

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:23.680
Probably because Hime-senpai went all out against me.

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:34.700
I may have lost today, but that just opens the door for me to get stronger tomorrow.

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:43.910
This Hime Curry really is spicy.

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:48.500
If I ever get the chance to compete with Hime-senpai again...

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:56.510
Yume! Yume! Yume!

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:03.850
Congratulations, Yume-chan.

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:06.560
Hime-senpai!

00:18:07.390 --> 00:18:08.400
Oh, my.

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:13.320
I used the frustration of losing in the 
S4 Selection as fuel to work even harder.

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:16.990
This is all thanks to you, Hime-senpai.

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:21.280
I might get the chance to say that.

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:33.710
Hime-senpai!

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:38.470
I'm gonna beat you next time, just you wait!

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:41.140
Yume-chan.

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:45.060
H-Hime-senpai!? Did you hear me?!

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:49.690
You got the Hime Curry. {should be Curry?}{probably}

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:52.060
Yes, the super spicy one.

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:54.070
Though it was a bit too spicy for me.

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:59.240
You really have grown.

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:03.580
I've always thought of you as an idol I couldn't leave alone.

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:04.580
What?

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:11.210
Since your first day, you've cried, smiled, and experienced many more things than anyone else.{fine I guess}

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:22.010
And each time, you grew stronger.

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:26.470
All of your experiences are reflected in your radiance. {I considered just substituting "Aikatsu" here}{I would not that}

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:34.940
Both smiles and tears are valuable experiences you should use to shine even brighter.

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:36.730
You'll be fine.

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:41.610
I'm sure that seeing you hard at work will bring happiness to people.{you know that the figure thing is a japanese right}{no way man}

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:45.740
That's Yume-chan, the rainbow idol. {I didn't say rainbow colored. Are you happy?}{Yes.}

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:48.950
The rainbow... idol?

00:19:58.170 --> 00:20:01.130
I'm going to take off toward the next stage.{mezashite style}{I actually do this by the seat of my pants}

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:05.260
Come join me one day.

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:08.520
I will!

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:15.770
Yume!

00:20:15.770 --> 00:20:17.070
Rola.

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:20.440
Sorry, am I interrupting?

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:22.530
No, it's all right.

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:26.370
Rola-chan, your performance today was wonderful.

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:29.660
Your song will surely reach the world.

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:32.160
That means so much!

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:38.590
Yume-chan and Rola-chan. We should be grateful for the miracle that brought you two together.

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:45.220
You should both understand just how important you are to each other. {Hime: Just kiss and get married already}

00:20:57.440 --> 00:21:01.110
Together, you can shine brighter than before.

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:03.200
I'll be waiting on a future stage.

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:04.360
Okay!

00:21:34.560 --> 00:21:36.600
You're late, Yume.

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:38.360
Morning.

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:41.650
Good morning. You're all early.

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:45.860
Of course. Soon we'll have 
underclassmen to set examples for.

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:47.700
It requires renewed determination.

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:51.370
That reminds me, Koharu-chan said she was working hard towards her dreams too.

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:54.000
When did you hear from her?!

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:56.000
She called just before my performance.

00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:57.420
Did she sound well?

00:21:57.420 --> 00:21:59.290
Where is she, and what is she doing?

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:02.000
Hey, don't all ask at once.

00:22:02.420 --> 00:22:05.340
She watched the whole S4 Selection.

00:22:05.340 --> 00:22:07.680
Everyone's performances touched her.

00:22:09.340 --> 00:22:14.020
Koharu-chan said she'd come back to us once she feels she's grown enough.

00:22:14.020 --> 00:22:15.600
It sounds like she's doing good.

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:17.850
That only motivates me more.

00:22:17.850 --> 00:22:19.020
Yeah!

00:22:19.980 --> 00:22:25.110
Further along this path is surely the stage we'll meet Koharu-chan and Hime-senpai on.

00:22:25.690 --> 00:22:28.740
I won't give up, no matter what happens.

00:22:28.740 --> 00:22:33.790
Chasing a new dream, Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:24:20.600 --> 00:24:24.350
I don't want our S4 senpai to graduate!

00:24:24.350 --> 00:24:28.230
Yume-chan, I leave the future of 
Flower Song Class in your hands.

00:24:28.230 --> 00:24:30.070
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:30.070 --> 00:24:31.530
The Greatest Performance. {line from episode solo}

00:24:31.530 --> 00:24:34.410
Become the first-star idol!
